UG\")\n   _HEADLINE=$(echo \"$_CREATOR_OUT\" | sed -n 's/^HEADLINE: //p')\n   _CATEGORY=$(echo \"$_CREATOR_OUT\" | sed -n 's/^CATEGORY: //p')\n   _SCENE_HINT=$(echo \"$_CREATOR_OUT\" | sed -n 's/^SCENE_HINT: //p')\n   _SAVE_TO=\"$RUN_DIR/media/feature.jpg\"\n   ```\n2. Spawn `creator`:\n   ```text\n   HEADLINE: <_HEADLINE>\n   CATEGORY: <_CATEGORY>\n   SCENE_HINT: <_SCENE_HINT>\n   SAVE_TO: <_SAVE_TO>\n   PROJECT_CONFIG: <PROJECT_CONFIG>\n   Craft prompt (<300 chars). Run generate.sh with OUTPUT_PATH=SAVE_TO, PROJECT_CONFIG, PROJECT_SLUG=$PROJECT_SLUG. Return SAVE_TO or IMAGE_FAILED: <reason>.\n   ```\n   Yield and wait.\n\n#### Step 2.4 — Drive Upload (Direct Bash — NO Subagent Spawn)\n```bash\npandoc -o \"$RUN_DIR/article/article.docx\" \"$RUN_DIR/article/final.md\"\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/verify_artifacts.py --stage pre_drive --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\"\ngog drive upload \"$RUN_DIR/article/article.docx\" --parent \"$DRIVE_PARENT_ID\" --account \"$DRIVE_ACCOUNT\"\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/save_google_drive_json.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\"\n```\n\n#### Step 2.5 — Per-Story User Confirmation Gate\nIf `STEP25_GATE == ON`:\n- Send Telegram message to `$GROUP_CHAT_ID` with headline, category, and Drive link.\n- STOP turn and wait for user reply (`yes`, `no`, or `stop`).\n- If `yes` $\\rightarrow$ proceed to Step 2.6.\n- If `no` $\\rightarrow$ mark pick `cancelled`, continue to next pick.\n- If `stop` $\\rightarrow$ cancel remaining picks, break to Step 3.\n\nIf `STEP25_GATE == OFF` (AUTO / FEED_DRAIN) $\\rightarrow$ proceed straight to Step 2.6.\n\n#### Step 2.6 — WordPress Publish (Direct Bash — NO Subagent Spawn)\n1. **Daily Cap Guard (AUTO only):**\n   If `RUN_MODE == AUTO`, verify `published_today($PROJECT_SLUG) < 4`. If limit reached, cancel remaining picks and break to Step 3.\n\n2. **Publish Draft:**\n   ```bash\n   bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n     --status draft --project \"$PROJECT_SLUG\" \\\n     --article \"$RUN_DIR/article/final.md\" --image \"$RUN_DIR/media/feature.jpg\"\n   ```\n\n3. **Track Tokens & Send Telegram Card:**\n   ```bash\n   python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/update_recent_topics.py \\\n     --current \"$RUN_DIR/research/validated.json\" \\\n     --registry ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/state/recent_topics.json \\\n     --run-id \"$RUN_ID-iter$PICK_INDEX\" --status drafted\n   python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/aggregate_run_tokens.py \\\n     --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n   python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/build_and_send_card.py \\\n     --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --project \"$PROJECT_SLUG\"\n   python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/update_pick_status.py \\\n     --pick-id $PICK_ID --status published\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### Step 3 — Batch Report & Cleanup\n\n1. Send final batch summary report to Telegram group `$GROUP_CHAT_ID`.\n2. Run cleanup **ONCE per batch**:\n   ```bash\n   bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/cleanup_run_artifacts.sh \"$RUN_DIR\"\n   ```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1785244495979}}
